  "name": "@rxap/nest-auth0",
  "description": "This package provides an Auth0 module for NestJS applications, simplifying integration with Auth0 for authentication and authorization. It includes a configurable module, JWT strategy, and service for interacting with the Auth0 Authentication API. The module also offers validation schemas for environment variables related to Auth0 configuration.\n",
